@* The landing page's map of the product: the three pillars of the brief, with what each does and where it stands. Two
   are open and one is not built yet; the third is shown disabled with its part, the same way the menu shows it. Status is
   a chip with an icon and a word, never colour alone. *@
<div class="smartx-pillars" role="list" aria-label="The three pillars of Smart-X">
    <MudPaper Outlined="true" Class="smartx-pillar pa-3" role="listitem">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" HtmlTag="h2">Sensor Data Ingestion and Telemetry</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">Register sensors, send readings, watch trust. You are here.</MudText>
        <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Success" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle">Open</MudChip>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Outlined="true" Class="smartx-pillar pa-3" role="listitem">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" HtmlTag="h2">Real-Time Command Stream and History</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">Live readings, queues, alerts, device commands and undo.</MudText>
        <MudButton Href="command-stream" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" Size="Size.Small"
                   StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Podcasts">Open command stream</MudButton>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Outlined="true" Class="smartx-pillar smartx-pillar--future pa-3" role="listitem" aria-disabled="true">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" HtmlTag="h2">Network Topology and Mesh Routing</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="mud-text-secondary">Not built yet.</MudText>
        <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Lock">Part 3</MudChip>
    </MudPaper>
</div>
